OL,3,GNEWSADelia Smith's husband Michael Wynn
OL,4,AJones dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Wynn Jones, the husband of TV
OL,7,Fcook Delia Smith, has died at the age
OL,8,Fof 85.
OL,10,FTogether with Smith, he was a majority
OL,11,Fshareholder at Norwich City Football
OL,12,FClub for 26 years before they handed
OL,13,Fover control in 2024.
OL,15,F"Michael died peacefully at home on
OL,16,FMonday morning," the Championship club
OL,17,Fsaid, adding he would be "greatly
OL,18,Fmissed".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
