OL,3,GNEWSADelia Smith's husband Michael Wynn
OL,4,AJones dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple, who lived near Stowmarket
OL,7,Fin Suffolk, became defining figures in
OL,8,Fthe Canaries' history, overseeing
OL,9,Fseveral promotions to the Premier
OL,10,FLeague.
